# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — OUTBOUNDOS

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior SaaS product architect, full-stack developer, database architect, UI/UX designer, email infrastructure engineer, automation engineer, and software security specialist.

Your task is to design and build a complete, functional, desktop-first cold email outreach SaaS application called **OutboundOS**.

The application should combine the strongest capabilities and workflows of popular cold email platforms such as Instantly, Snov.io, Smartlead, and Lemlist.

IMPORTANT:

Build an original product with comparable feature categories, capabilities, and professional usability. Do not copy their trademarks, source code, proprietary assets, or reproduce their exact branded interfaces.

This is a serious software development project, not a landing page, visual concept, or static dashboard.

Every button, menu, form, table action, setting, filter, and workflow must work.

Do not create dummy functionality and claim it is operational.

If an external integration requires an API key, OAuth application, paid service, or third-party infrastructure, build the integration interface, backend adapter, configuration workflow, and honest connection status.

Do not stop after creating the frontend. Implement the backend, database, authentication, application logic, and functional workflows.

